    "attributes": {
        "action": "Expel all US military personnel from UK bases & request for the UK to join BRICS",
        "additional_details": "BRICS countries make up around 55% of the global population, over 40% of the World\u2019s GDP, and possess abundant natural resources, making them one of the main driving forces of global economic development.\r\n \r\nWe believe that the UK has been in the economic grip of the United States of America for too long.",
        "background": "We call on the UK Government to expel all US military personnel from all military bases in the UK and submit a formal application requesting that the UK join BRICS \u2013 an intergovernmental organisation containing Brazil, Russia, India, China and South Africa.",
